# Rustyfin AI Agent Rules

Always adhere strictly to the standards defined in `RUST_STANDARDS.md`.

Key directives:
1. Axum 0.7 routes must use `:param` (not `{param}`).
2. All Jellyfin API DTOs must use `#[serde(rename_all = "PascalCase")]`.
3. Never block the Tokio runtime with synchronous operations (use `spawn_blocking` if needed).
4. Never buffer full video/audio streams into RAM; use zero-copy `tokio_util::io::ReaderStream` with HTTP 206 Partial Content range requests.
5. SQLite must operate with `PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;`.
6. No `unwrap()` or `expect()` in API route handlers or long-running tasks.
7. Run `cargo check` after any code modifications.
